msgstr "Asisten tanpa nama"

#. translators: heading over the assistants another user has authorized.
#: app/Mcp/Profile.php:250
msgid "AI assistant connections"
msgstr "Koneksi asisten AI"

#. translators: heading over the assistants this person has authorized.
#: app/Mcp/Profile.php:290
msgid "Your authorized assistants"
msgstr "Asisten Anda yang diotorisasi"

#. translators: shown to an administrator looking at someone else's profile.
#: app/Mcp/Profile.php:328
msgid "AI assistants this user has authorized. Only they can add new ones, but you can revoke any of them."
msgstr "Asisten AI yang telah diotorisasi oleh pengguna ini. Hanya ia yang dapat menambahkan yang baru, tetapi Anda dapat mencabut yang mana saja."

#. translators: the assistant acts with this person's permissions but cannot change anything.
#: app/Mcp/Profile.php:336
msgid "Connect an AI assistant to your site so it can look things up for you. It cannot change anything."
msgstr "Hubungkan asisten AI ke situs Anda agar dapat mencari informasi untuk Anda. Asisten ini tidak dapat mengubah apa pun."

#. translators: the assistant acts with this person's own permissions.
#: app/Mcp/Profile.php:343
msgid "Connect an AI assistant to work on your site."
msgstr "Hubungkan asisten AI untuk bekerja di situs Anda."

#. translators: shown when the site is reachable only inside its own network.
#: app/Mcp/Profile.php:358
msgid "This site needs to be publicly accessible for an AI assistant to connect to it."
msgstr "Situs ini harus dapat diakses secara publik agar asisten AI dapat terhubung ke situs ini."

#. translators: HTTPS is a protocol name; keep it in English.
#: app/Mcp/Profile.php:363
msgid "This site needs to be served over HTTPS for an AI assistant to connect to it."
msgstr "Situs ini perlu menggunakan HTTPS agar asisten AI dapat terhubung ke situs ini."

#. translators: shown when the whole site sits behind a password prompt.
#: app/Mcp/Profile.php:368
msgid "Remove the site's password protection so an AI assistant can connect to it."
msgstr "Hapus perlindungan kata sandi situs agar asisten AI dapat terhubung ke situs tersebut."

#. translators: names the likely causes when requests from outside never arrive.
